// QLAB-002 · C6 — energia do estado fundamental do H2 (STO-3G, R=0.735 Å, Jordan-Wigner)
portão ⟨|⟩ "energia eletronica do H2 via VQE":
qbit a ← X × |0⟩
qbit b ← X × |0⟩
qbit c ← |0⟩
qbit d ← Ry(θ) × |0⟩
d, a ← CNOT × (d, a)
d, b ← CNOT × (d, b)
d, c ← CNOT × (d, c)
θ ← otimizar(esperança(H(a)))
→ 1 | 0 | REFUSED
